        teacherNotes: "summarythis weekfocus: (1) official Sec 2 AEIS math paper format: Part 1 MCQ 34 problem 30 min + Part 2 show working 20+10–15 problem 1 hour 45 min, without calculator. (2) this weekcontent: Sec 2 NUMBER AND ALGEBRA, N5. Algebraic manipulation: 5.15 multiplication and division of simple algebraic fractions（代number分formula乘除）. this weekis N5.15 only. Official method: Multiply: (3a/4b) × (5ab/3) = (3a × 5ab) / (4b × 3) = (15a²b) / (12b). Cancel: 15÷3=5, 12÷3=4, cancel b. Answer: (5a²) / 4. Divide: (3a/4) ÷ (9a²/10) = (3a/4) × (10/9a²) (flip second fraction). Multiply: (30a) / (36a²). Cancel: 30÷6=5, 36÷6=6, cancel one a. Answer: 5 / (6a). Keep items at this SIMPLE level: monomial over monomial (one term over one term), cancel common number and letter factors, leave the answer in simplest form. Integers after cancel. No calculator. Friendly integers. No adding/subtracting fractions (that is 5.16). No linear/quadratic binomial denominators like (x+1) or (x²+2x+1) (that is 5.16). Fossil: forgetting to flip the second fraction when dividing ((3a/4) ÷ (9a²/10) = (3a/4) × (9a²/10) ✗, should be (3a/4) × (10/9a²) ✓); or cancelling incorrectly (cancelling 3a and 9a² to get 1 and 3, forgetting the remaining a in denominator; correct: cancel one a, denominator still has one a left, so answer is 5/(6a) not 5/6). this weekdon't teach 5.16 addition and subtraction of algebraic fractions with linear or quadratic denominators（代number分formula加减）. this weeknot重teach 5.14 factorisation of quadratic expressions（Week 64 weekalready taught）. this weeknot重teach 5.13 grouping（Week 63 weekalready taught）. this weeknot重teach 5.12 identities（Week 62 weekalready taught）. Cast: secondary Wei, Aisha, Mr Lim at Riverside Secondary. Week 8–56 week completed Sec 1 content. Week 57 week completed Sec 2 N2.4 map scales. Week 58 week completed Sec 2 N2.5 direct and inverse proportion. Week 59 week completed Sec 2 N5.9 expansion of the product of algebraic expressions. Week 60 week completed Sec 2 N5.10 changing the subject of a formula. Week 61 week completed Sec 2 N5.11 finding the value of an unknown quantity in a given formula. Week 62 week completed Sec 2 N5.12 identities: (a+b)², (a−b)², a²−b². Week 63 week completed Sec 2 N5.13 factorisation of linear expressions ax+bx+kay+kby. Week 64 week completed Sec 2 N5.14 factorisation of quadratic expressions ax²+bx+c. this weekcontinue Sec 2 content（Sec 3 applicationperson preceding level）. 'Tell the parent: 'this weekHigh-frequency error focus: forgetting to flip the second fraction when dividing（除法time忘记Weektwo分number倒过来: (3a/4) ÷ (9a²/10) error地calculatebecome (3a/4) × (9a²/10), shouldfirst 9a²/10 倒become 10/9a², again乘: (3a/4) × (10/9a²) ✓）; or cancelling incorrectly（消去error, only消number字not消字母, or person消字母timecalculatewrongtimes幂, For example (30a)/(36a²) 消become (5a)/(6a²) 就停了, 忘记 numerator has a¹ and denominator has a², 还canagain消one a, correctshouldis 5/(6a)）. correctdo法: Multiply: multiply numerators and denominators, then cancel ALL common factors (numbers and letters). Divide: flip the second fraction then multiply, then cancel ALL common factors. Leave the answer in simplest form (no common factors remain).'请atparent端查看childhomework提交, 关注thisHigh-frequency errorerror. 'correctchildSay: 'Great work today! Remember: Official 5.15 is multiply and divide simple algebraic fractions. Multiply: (numerator1 × numerator2) / (denominator1 × denominator2), then cancel. Divide: flip the second fraction then multiply, then cancel. Cancel ALL common factors: numbers AND letters. Always leave your answer in simplest form. (3a/4b)×(5ab/3)=(5a²)/4 ✓. (3a/4)÷(9a²/10)=5/(6a) ✓.'鼓励child并结束课程. ",
