        teacherNotes: "summarythis weekfocus: (1) official Sec 2 AEIS math paper format: Part 1 MCQ 34 problem 30 min + Part 2 show working 20+10–15 problem 1 hour 45 min, without calculator. (2) this weekcontent: Sec 2 NUMBER AND ALGEBRA, N7. Equations and inequalities: 7.8 solving simultaneous linear equations in two variables by: substitution and elimination methods, graphical method（solvetwodollaronetimes联立equation: 代入法, 消dollar法, 图solve法）. this weekis N7.8 only. Official content: (1) a pair of linear equations in x and y; the solution is the pair (x, y) that satisfies both. (2) substitution: make one variable the subject of one equation, substitute into the other. (3) elimination: add or subtract equations after matching a coefficient. (4) graphical: each equation is a line; the solution is the intersection point. (5) check by substituting the solution back into both equations. Friendly integers only. No calculator. This week is N7.8 only: solving simultaneous linear equations in two variables by substitution (make one variable the subject, substitute into the other), elimination (add or subtract equations to cancel one variable), and graphical (each equation is a line; the solution is the intersection point). Check by substituting back into both equations. this weekdon't teach 7.9 quadratic equations by factorisation（don't teach因formula分solvesolveonedollartwotimesequation）. this weekdon't teach 7.10 formulating a pair from a word problem as the main skill（not'从shoulduseproblem列equation组'work为this week主need技can）. (3) this weekHigh-frequency error: offering both substitution and elimination as two correct options for the same pair on the same item（atsameoneproblemabove, sametime提供代入法 and 消dollar法work为two「correct'option）; or offering both 'the intersection is (a,b)' and 「x=a, y=b' as two keyed-correct options on one item（atsameoneproblemabove, sametime提供'交pointis (a,b)' and 「x=a, y=b'work为twocorrectoption）; writing pairs that copy BoardWeike examples（照抄BoardWeikeequation组）; non-integer answers（answernotinteger）; claiming a pair has two solutions（声称onecorrectnotsame直线hastwosolve）. (4) remindchild: Week 72 weekhomeworkat app 里, belowweek见. Cast: secondary Wei, Aisha, Mr Lim at Riverside Secondary School. Friendly integers. No calculator.'",
