        teacherNotes: "summarythis weekfocus: (1) official Sec 2 AEIS math paper format: Part 1 MCQ 34 problem 30 min + Part 2 show working 20+10–15 problem 1 hour 45 min, without calculator. (2) this weekcontent: Sec 2 NUMBER AND ALGEBRA, N7. Equations and inequalities: 7.10 formulating a pair of linear equations in two variables to solve problems（从shoulduseproblem列twodollaronetimesequation组）. this weekis N7.10 only. Official content: (1) read the word problem carefully, identify the two unknown quantities, and define variables (let x = ... and y = ...) clearly; (2) translate each condition in the problem into a linear equation in x and y; (3) write the pair of equations together as a system; (4) the problem may then ask you to solve the system by substitution or elimination; (5) check your solution makes sense in the context of the problem; (6) integer coefficients and integer solutions only (friendly integers, no calculator). This week is N7.10 only: formulating a pair of linear equations in two variables to solve problems. Read the problem, identify the two unknowns, define x and y, identify the two conditions, translate each into an equation, write the pair, then (if asked) solve by substitution or elimination. Check your solution. this weekfocus: formulating the pair（列equation组), not re-teaching elimination methods（not重新teachsolveequation组消dollar法; Week 72 weekalready taught N7.8 solving）. (3) this weekHigh-frequency error: same pair in swapped order as two options; x/y swapped vs story (2x+y vs x+2y); one equation plus a dependent equation (sum/double); forming only one equation when story needs two; copying BoardWeike numbers in writing. (4) homework: app has 5  reading + 8  grammar + 3  writing. Reading and grammar are MCQ keyed A. Writing needs full working steps. Integer solutions only. No calculator. (5) this weekteach学工具: BoardWeike whiteboardexample problem（on whiteboardthree列equation组example problem), 帮助你记住列equation组steps. (6) Week 72 week completed N7.8 solving simultaneous linear equations in two variables（solvetwodollaronetimes联立equation）. Week 73 week completed N7.9 quadratic equations in one variable by factorisation（因formula分solvesolveonedollartwotimesequation）. this weekWeek 74 weekcomplete N7.10 formulating a pair of linear equations in two variables to solve problems（从shoulduseproblem列twodollaronetimesequation组）. belowweekcontinue新content. Singapore Teaching Practice: 准备 Preparation（BoardWeike and whiteboardexample problem）, model I do（teachermodel）, 带练 We do（师生one起do）, 独立 You do（学生do independently）, Key questions and AfL 形become性评价, 收口summary. Readiness: 识别two未知量, 定义变量. Engagement: 真实情境（stamps, stationery, class composition）. Mastery: correct列outequation组, findsolve, 检验. Positive classroom culture: 'today你学会了从shoulduseproblem列equation组, thisissolve决实际askproblem重need技can. Keep practicing!'",
